**Deployment model:** Kubernetes-orchestrated, containerized from day one to support on-premise, private cloud, and hybrid deployments without architectural rework.

**Technology stack:**

| Function | Technology |
|---|---|
| Event streaming | Apache Kafka 4.x (KRaft) |
| Stream processing | Apache Flink 2.x |
| ML training | Python / PyTorch / scikit-learn / Fairlearn |
| ML serving | Seldon Core on Kubernetes |
| Model registry | MLflow |
| Event analytics | ClickHouse |
| Graph database | Neo4j Enterprise |
| Relational store | PostgreSQL 16 |
| Document search | Elasticsearch 8 |
| Hot cache | Redis 7 |
| Audit log | WORM-compliant append-only store with hash chaining |
| API layer | FastAPI (Python) + Go for high-throughput connectors |
| Frontend | React + TypeScript |
| Orchestration | Kubernetes + Helm |
