**Security hardening:**
- All inter-service communication encrypted via mTLS
- Secrets managed exclusively through Vault — never in environment variables or config files
- Network microsegmentation policies between all layers
- Zero-trust internal network: no service trusted by virtue of network position alone
- Penetration testing required before each major release and annually
- Vulnerability scanning integrated into CI/CD pipeline as a blocking gate
