## 10. Success Metrics

### Operational
- Mean time to human review: < 2 hours for Critical tier alerts
- False positive rate: < 10% for High and Critical tiers (measured monthly)
- Alert-to-case conversion rate by tier
- Case resolution time by intervention type
- Analyst workload: cases reviewed per analyst-hour

### Safety Outcomes
- Reduction in situations that escalated without prior warning signals detected
- Appropriateness of interventions (tracked via structured case outcome review)
