- Longitudinal subject outcome tracking: positive trajectory, stable, or escalation despite intervention
- Zero documented civil rights violations attributable to platform activity

### Model Quality
- Precision and recall by signal type and modality
- Bias disparity ratio across demographic groups (hard ceiling: 1.2x — triggers model suspension)
- Model drift score (triggers mandatory review if threshold crossed)
- Explainability quality score (BTAM team member rating of alert reasoning clarity)
- Fairness test pass rate across all model deployments

### Compliance & Governance
- Zero data retention policy violations
- 100% audit log completeness and integrity verification
- PIA completion rate for all new data sources (target: 100% before activation)
- Time to close identified privacy incidents (target: < 72 hours for critical)
- Governance board meeting attendance and resolution completion rate

### Community Trust
- Anonymous tip-line utilization rate (indicator of community confidence in reporting)
- BTAM team confidence survey (semi-annual)
- Institutional leadership confidence survey (annual)
